      examTips: ["Frame reconciliation explicitly as an operational risk control that catches errors and fraud early — not simply an accounting housekeeping task — since this framing is exactly what CPCM tends to reward.", "Have straight-through processing (STP) ready as the concept that connects reconciliation to automation — fewer manual steps genuinely means fewer exceptions to investigate."],
